{"id":"62665d12-67f9-49f9-a0e9-dc8ad7ae55f8","createdAt":"2026-10-26T11:49:03.260Z","batchId":"settings_qwen3-8-flash-gateway_low","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"settings","prompt":"An account settings panel with profile, notifications and privacy sections.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .tabbar { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hr, rgba(128,128,128,.25)); padding-bottom: .25rem; }\n  .tab[aria-selected=\"true\"] { font-weight: 600; }\n  .field-note { margin-top: .15rem; }\n  .setting-row { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:1rem; padding:.85rem 0; border-top:1px solid var(--hr, rgba(128,128,128,.2)); }\n  .setting-row:first-child { border-top:none; padding-top:.25rem; }\n  .setting-copy { flex:1; }\n  .setting-copy .muted { display:block; margin-top:.15rem; }\n  .avatar-wrap { flex-shrink:0; }\n  .danger-zone { border:1px solid rgba(220,38,38,.35); }\n  @media (max-width:640px){ .field-note{ display:none; } }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <h1>Account settings</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Manage your profile, decide how we reach you, and control who can see your activity on Nimbus.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"margin-top:.25rem\">\n      <span class=\"badge\">Pro plan</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Member since 2021</span>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Last sign-in 2h ago</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n  <div class=\"row gap-sm tabbar\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Settings sections\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-profile\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"panel-profile\" data-tab=\"profile\">Profile</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-notifications\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-notifications\" data-tab=\"notifications\">Notifications</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-privacy\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-privacy\" data-tab=\"privacy\">Privacy &amp; security</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- PROFILE -->\n  <section class=\"card stack\" id=\"panel-profile\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-profile\">\n    <div class=\"between\" style=\"align-items:center\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:.25rem\">Profile</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">This is how your name and details appear across the product and in shared reports.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" id=\"saveProfile\">Save changes</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"row gap-lg\" style=\"align-items:center\">\n      <div class=\"avatar-wrap\"><div class=\"avatar\" aria-label=\"Avatar for Maya Chen\">MC</div></div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\" style=\"flex:1\">\n        <div class=\"between\">\n          <div>\n            <strong>Profile completeness</strong>\n            <span class=\"muted small\" style=\"display:block\">Add a bio and a location to reach 100%.</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-secondary\">Change photo</button>\n            <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost btn-destructive\">Remove</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuenow=\"80\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\"><div style=\"width:80%\"></div></div>\n        <span class=\"small muted\">80% — 4 of 5 fields complete</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"hr\">\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n      <label>Display name\n        <input type=\"text\" value=\"Maya Chen\">\n      </label>\n      <label>Username\n        <input type=\"text\" value=\"maya.chen\">\n        <span class=\"muted small field-note\">nimbus.app/@maya.chen</span>\n      </label>\n      <label>Email address\n        <input type=\"email\" value=\"maya.chen@example.com\">\n        <span class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;margin-top:.3rem\"><span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Verified</span><a href=\"#\" class=\"small\" style=\"color:inherit\">Change email</a></span>\n      </label>\n      <label>Location\n        <select>\n          <option>Toronto, Canada</option>\n          <option selected>Toronto, Canada</option>\n          <option>Lisbon, Portugal</option>\n          <option>Remote</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n      <label>Website\n        <input type=\"url\" value=\"https://mayachen.design\">\n      </label>\n      <label>Timezone\n        <select>\n          <option selected>Eastern Time (UTC−5)</option>\n          <option>Western European (UTC+0)</option>\n          <option>Pacific Time (UTC−8)</option>\n        </select>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <label>Bio\n      <textarea rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"A short line about you shown on your team card…\">Product designer focused on data-heavy interfaces and design systems.</textarea>\n    </label>\n\n    <div class=\"alert\">\n      <strong>Display name pending review.</strong> Changes to your name are shown publicly within 24 hours.\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- NOTIFICATIONS -->\n  <section class=\"card stack\" id=\"panel-notifications\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-notifications\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"between\" style=\"align-items:center\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:.25rem\">Notifications</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Choose what we send you and where it lands. Security alerts are always on.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" id=\"saveNotif\">Save preferences</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <h3>Email</h3>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Mentions &amp; replies</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">When someone @-mentions you or replies to a comment.</span>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Report digests</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Weekly summary of shared dashboards you follow.</span>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Product updates</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">New features and changelog highlights, about once a month.</span>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Off</label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Marketing &amp; offers</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Tips, events and promotions. Noisy — most people keep this off.</span>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Off</label>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <h3>Push &amp; in-app</h3>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Desktop push</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Real-time alerts while the app is open.</span>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Failed jobs &amp; errors</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Immediate alert when a scheduled sync fails.</span>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Security alerts</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">New sign-ins, password changes and 2FA updates. <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Required</span></span>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> Always on</label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"alert\">\n      <strong>Quiet hours active.</strong> Push notifications are muted from 22:00 to 07:00 in your timezone.\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- PRIVACY -->\n  <section class=\"card stack\" id=\"panel-privacy\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-privacy\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"between\" style=\"align-items:center\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"card-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:.25rem\">Privacy &amp; security</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">Control your visibility, third-party sharing, and how your account is protected.</p>\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\" id=\"savePrivacy\">Save changes</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stack\">\n      <h3>Profile visibility</h3>\n      <div class=\"row gap-lg\">\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"vis\" checked> Visible to my team</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"vis\"> Visible to the workspace</label>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"vis\"> Private — only me</label>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <h3>Activity &amp; data</h3>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Show online status</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Let teammates see when you're active.</span>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Share usage analytics</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Anonymised product telemetry that helps us improve. <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Never sold</span></span>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> On</label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Personalised recommendations</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Tailor dashboard templates using your recent activity.</span>\n        </div>\n        <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Off</label>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr\">\n      <h3>Security</h3>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Two-factor authentication <span class=\"badge badge-destructive\">Strongly recommended</span></strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Currently disabled. Set up an authenticator app in under a minute.</span>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-secondary\">Enable 2FA</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Password</strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">Last changed 14 months ago.</span>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-outline\">Change password</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"setting-row\">\n        <div class=\"setting-copy\">\n          <strong>Active sessions <span class=\"muted small\">— 3 devices</span></strong>\n          <span class=\"muted small\">MacBook Pro · Toronto — current. iPad Air · Toronto. Windows PC · Lisbon.</span>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-ghost btn-destructive\">Sign out others</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card danger-zone stack\">\n      <h3 style=\"margin-bottom:.1rem\">Delete account</h3>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Permanently remove your profile, dashboards and history. This cannot be undone and may take up to 30 days to fully clear.</p>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-destructive\">Delete my account</button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Request data export instead</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <p class=\"muted small\">All changes are saved to your account immediately. <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:inherit\">View audit log</a></p>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.tab');\n    var panels = {\n      profile: document.getElementById('panel-profile'),\n      notifications: document.getElementById('panel-notifications'),\n      privacy: document.getElementById('panel-privacy')\n    };\n    function activate(name) {\n      tabs.forEach(function (t) {\n        var on = t.getAttribute('data-tab') === name;\n        t.setAttribute('aria-selected', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n        t.classList.toggle('btn-secondary', on);\n        t.classList.toggle('btn-ghost', !on);\n      });\n      Object.keys(panels).forEach(function (k) { panels[k].hidden = (k !== name); });\n    }\n    tabs.forEach(function (t) {\n      t.addEventListener('click', function () { activate(t.getAttribute('data-tab')); });\n    });\n    activate('profile');\n\n    function flash(btn) {\n      var orig = btn.textContent;\n      btn.textContent = 'Saved ✓';\n      btn.disabled = true;\n      setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = orig; btn.disabled = false; }, 1400);\n    }\n    ['saveProfile', 'saveNotif', 'savePrivacy'].forEach(function (id) {\n      var b = document.getElementById(id);\n      if (b) b.addEventListener('click', function () { flash(b); });\n    });\n  })();\n</script>","deltas":[[6353,"<style"